@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About - TenHourGuitarist</PageTitle>

<section class="bg-dark text-white py-5">
    <div class="container text-center">
        <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold">About TenHourGuitarist</h1>
        <p class="lead mt-3">Helping aspiring guitarists reach their potential since day one.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="container py-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-8">
            <h2 class="mb-4">Our Mission</h2>
            <p class="fs-5">
                TenHourGuitarist was born from a simple idea: anyone can learn to play guitar with the right
                guidance, structured practice, and a supportive community. Our platform provides expert-led
                courses designed to take you from your first chord to confident playing.
            </p>

            <h3 class="mt-5 mb-3">What We Offer</h3>
            <div class="row g-4 mt-2">
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <h5 class="card-title">Structured Courses</h5>
                            <p class="card-text">
                                Step-by-step lessons organized by skill level, from beginner fundamentals
                                to advanced techniques. Each course is carefully crafted to build on
                                the previous one.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <h5 class="card-title">Expert Instruction</h5>
                            <p class="card-text">
                                Learn from experienced instructors who break down complex concepts into
                                easy-to-follow lessons with clear demonstrations and practical exercises.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <h5 class="card-title">Free Resources</h5>
                            <p class="card-text">
                                Access a library of free lessons, blog articles, and podcasts to supplement
                                your learning and stay inspired on your guitar journey.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-md-6">
                    <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="card-body">
                            <h5 class="card-title">Flexible Subscriptions</h5>
                            <p class="card-text">
                                Choose a subscription plan that fits your schedule and budget. Cancel anytime.
                                Get full access to our entire course library with a single subscription.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <h3 class="mt-5 mb-3">Our Approach</h3>
            <p class="fs-5">
                We believe that learning guitar should be enjoyable and accessible. Our curriculum is
                designed around the idea that consistent, focused practice in short sessions leads to
                better results than marathon study sessions. That is why we emphasize quality over
                quantity in every lesson we create.
            </p>
            <p class="fs-5">
                Whether you want to strum your favorite songs around a campfire, master fingerstyle
                arrangements, or shred electric solos, TenHourGuitarist has a path for you.
            </p>

            <div class="text-center mt-5">
                <a href="/courses" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg me-2">Explore Courses</a>
                <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-lg">Get in Touch</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
